ield in DiffTest for -t flag testing\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Write the modified `cmd/expand/main.go` with -t flag support and the modified `cmd/expand/expand_test.go` with R2.1-R2.4 test cases, then build and test. The task description states: \"Implement srd024-expand requirement R2.1 per the SRD specification\" through R2.4, and the acceptance criteria require each R2.x to be \"implemented and covered by at least one differential test case\" plus compilation and tests passing.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5268/90e916e3-9a57-43df-b341-b74db7c6ff8c.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"90e916e3-9a57-43df-b341-b74db7c6ff8c","uuid":"2888f360-a5ec-4efb-a7cd-b0250748b7ea","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:07:15.618Z","isSynthetic":true}
